module

public import Theory.Representation.QuasithinRankTwoInvolutionExclusions.Basic

/-!
# Tools for excluding binary symplectic rank-two involutions

The imported tools transport moved spaces and their stabilizer orbits through
actual equivalences of representations. They include the dimension obstruction
and an order-three criterion for transitivity on a moved plane.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, G.11.2
(printed p.364), and the proof of 6.2.19 (printed p.691). Concrete calculations
for G.11.2(2)–(13), including the long-root branch of G₂(2), remain to be supplied;
this module does not yet assert those exclusions or the exhaustive classification.
-/
